# Frontend UI

- Import design language from `app/ds.css` (via `globals.css`). Prefer classes: `page`, `metric-card`, `action-card`, `panel`, `list-row`, `btn-primary|secondary|ghost`, `t-h1|h2|h3|body|body-sm|caption`, `field`, `nav-link`.
- Shell: `components/layout/studio-shell.tsx` — do not add a second nav in page content.
- One `--accent` (`#000080`) filled button per screen. Featured action card uses accent border, not a second primary fill unless the top bar has no CTA.
- Flat color + frosted glass only — no decorative gradients; shadows ≤ `0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.06)`.
- Keep resume sheet CSS (`.resume-print`, template families) monochrome/ATS when editing `globals.css`.
- After UI changes: `docker compose up -d --build` (updates frontend image; backend if needed).
- PDF compile hits the **backend** at `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL/api/compile-resume`, not the Next image.
